            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ii0PHoCljhdFSEO1V"
              ><p><strong>"Why can’t I quit?"</strong></p></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text imXypQt48rjc0mUpp"><p>Does that sound familiar? It starts as a quick fix for stress, a way to fill the quiet moments. But before you know it, you&apos;re caught in a cycle—expensive, frustrating, and harmful.</p><p></p><p>The worst part? Even when you’re ready to quit, it feels impossible. The cravings, the hand-to-mouth urge, the constant mental battle—every "solution" out there seems to fail before it even begins.</p></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ivpu24okUeIgtZg35"
              ><p><em>"Most solutions fail because they treat the symptoms, not the habit,"</em> </p><p>says <strong>Dr. Emily Carter.</strong> "</p><p></p><p><em>True success comes from breaking both the physical and mental cycle."</em></p></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iHOye2xALx2N7c0Mo"
              ><p><em>"Most solutions fail because they treat the symptoms, not the habit,"</em> says <strong>Dr. Emily Carter.</strong></p></div
            ><div data-instant-type="image" class="iIAKYnLGFB90QNSiy"><img alt="" sizes="(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px" srcSet="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/PGbHcKP2M0mMxRQT/pexels-mastercowley-89781711zon.webp?width=1080 1080w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/PGbHcKP2M0mMxRQT/pexels-mastercowley-89781711zon.webp?width=828 828w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/PGbHcKP2M0mMxRQT/pexels-mastercowley-89781711zon.webp?width=750 750w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/PGbHcKP2M0mMxRQT/pexels-mastercowley-89781711zon.webp?width=640 640w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/PGbHcKP2M0mMxRQT/pexels-mastercowley-89781711zon.webp?width=360 360w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/PGbHcKP2M0mMxRQT/pexels-mastercowley-89781711zon.webp?width=1280 1280w" src="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/PGbHcKP2M0mMxRQT/pexels-mastercowley-89781711zon.webp?width=1280" width="1000" height="1000" decoding="async" loading="eager" fetchpriority="auto" class="instant-image instant-image__main instant-responsive instant-responsive--desktop instant-responsive--laptop instant-responsive--tablet"><img alt="" sizes="(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px" srcSet="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/PGbHcKP2M0mMxRQT/pexels-mastercowley-89781711zon.webp?width=1080 1080w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/PGbHcKP2M0mMxRQT/pexels-mastercowley-89781711zon.webp?width=828 828w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/PGbHcKP2M0mMxRQT/pexels-mastercowley-89781711zon.webp?width=750 750w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/PGbHcKP2M0mMxRQT/pexels-mastercowley-89781711zon.webp?width=640 640w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/PGbHcKP2M0mMxRQT/pexels-mastercowley-89781711zon.webp?width=360 360w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/1ATWZ62dPhRUmsuT/assets/PGbHcKP2M0mMxRQT/pexels-mastercowley-89781711z